  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Half a Lifetime**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Oxen**: back after 312 archived shows (7121 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **River Road**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Ride On**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Lemme Know**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Remnants**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Come Closer**: back after 170 archived shows (4632 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **I Can Hear Your Love**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2025-04-18.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 143 min [1]\n- **mmj2025-04-18.flac16**: source not stated; 25 songs; 143 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Grace Cummings opened the show; notes also mention an AC/DC cover with her on vocals [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2025-04-18.flac24**: taped by bersey; transferred by bersey; source: CA-11 > CA-9100 > Sony PCM-M10 [1]. Also: Recorded from Section 2RT, Row BB, Seat 14, right stack, with microphones roughly nine feet high; Chain: CA-11 cardioid mics into CA-9100 into Sony PCM-M10 at 24-bit/48kHz, edited in Sound Forge, encoded to FLAC [1]\n- **mmj2025-04-18.flac16**: taped by bersey; transferred by bersey; source: CA-11 > CA-9100 > Sony PCM-M10 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by WONDERVAULTS: [My Morning Jacket April 18 2025 Riverside Theater in Milwaukee Tour Shirt,Sweater, Hoodie, And Long Sleeved, Ladies, Tan](https://legendwearco.com/product/my-morning-jacket-april-18-2025-riverside-theater-in-milwaukee-tour-shirt/) [4]\n- Fan art by Teesmithy: [My Morning Jacket With Grace Cummings For Milwaukee Wisconsin At The Riverside Theater On April 18 2025 Hourglass 3D Shi](https://teesmithy.com/products/my-morning-jacket-with-grace-cummings-for-milwaukee-wisconsin-at-the-riverside-theater-on-april-18-2025-hourglass-3d-shirt/) [5]\n- Poster by AllEvents: [My Morning Jacket in Milwaukee](https://allevents.in/milwaukee/my-morning-jacket-in-milwaukee/3300027820144451) [6]",
